  "model_type": "minimax_m3",
  "_comment": "MiniMax-M3.1 TEXT backbone, flattened from the checkpoint's HF text_config. Differs from MiniMax-M3 in rope_theta (1e7), the attention schedule (every layer MSA: sparse_attention_freq all 1, index value branch disabled), extra sparse_* switches (all off) and no MTP fields. The checkpoint is quantized: MXFP8 linears (block [1,32]) and compressed-tensors NVFP4 routed experts (group 16), dequantized to bf16 at load (utils/checkpoint.py); quantization_config holds the format fields the loader checks (ignored_layers omitted). Multimodal vision_config omitted (out of scope). Layer schedule: layers 0-2 dense MLP, 3-59 MoE; MSA attention on all 60.",
  "attention_dropout": 0.0,
  "head_dim": 128,
  "hidden_size": 6144,
  "num_attention_heads": 64,
  "num_key_value_heads": 4,
  "num_hidden_layers": 60,
  "vocab_size": 200064,
  "max_position_embeddings": 1048576,
  "rms_norm_eps": 1e-06,
  "rope_theta": 10000000,
  "rotary_dim": 64,
  "partial_rotary_factor": 0.5,
  "use_qk_norm": true,
